00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:10.590
territory, that it is likely

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.091
the president will choose to shoot it

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:12.292
down?

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:13.927
The president will always act

00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:14.761
in the best interest

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:15.929
of our national security

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:17.197
and in the safety and security

00:03:17.197 --> 00:03:18.932
of the American people.

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:20.600
Jackie, we're going to take

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.969
John to the Pentagon or this new object

00:03:22.969 --> 00:03:24.704
be taken down over Alaska.

00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:25.972
The president ordered it.

00:03:25.972 --> 00:03:26.806
President ordered it.

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:27.440
So is it a fair

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:28.274
take away, then,

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:29.776
