00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:39.586
the way that we

00:03:39.586 --> 00:03:42.622
handled the first balloon and that time.

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:44.190
First of all,

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.326
apples and oranges here in terms of size.

00:03:46.326 --> 00:03:46.893
As I said,

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:48.962
this was size of a small car

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:50.096
